" id=\"ucdd2ed70\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #117CEE\">只读</span><span data-lake-id=\"u62453a84\" id=\"u62453a84\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)\">变量。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctconst%20int%20num%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22num%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20num)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctnum%20%3D%20100%3B%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%20%5B%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%5D%20assignment%20of%20read-only%20variable%20'num'%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JIfPz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dBIZB%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"vcG2X\" id=\"vcG2X\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ec6954a\" id=\"u2ec6954a\">3&gt; 枚举常量 enum</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u0e1221c2\" id=\"u0e1221c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb213e33\" id=\"ucb213e33\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)\">枚举（</span><code data-lake-id=\"u734b5efd\" id=\"u734b5efd\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u173d1a22\" id=\"u173d1a22\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: #601BDE\">enum</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u41b57101\" id=\"u41b57101\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)\">）/ˈenəm/</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u734fca7c\" id=\"u734fca7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u749cc45b\" id=\"u749cc45b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)\">是一种用户自定义的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud68487e8\" id=\"ud68487e8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #2F4BDA\">数据类型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6ba3a51d\" id=\"u6ba3a51d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)\">，用于定义一组命名的常量。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc0be2288\" id=\"uc0be2288\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34ca6a6d\" id=\"u34ca6a6d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)\">枚举常量是枚举类型中的成员，它们本质上是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e4cdbe6\" id=\"u0e4cdbe6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">int</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc55334c5\" id=\"uc55334c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">类型</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud00ea1d1\" id=\"ud00ea1d1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)\">整数值；</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%20%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cnenum%20Weekday%20%7B%5Cn%5CtMONDAY%2C%5Ct%20%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%BA%200%5Cn%5CtTUESDAY%2C%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%201%5Cn%5CtWEDNESDAY%2C%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%202%5Cn%5CtTHURSDAY%2C%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%203%5Cn%5CtFRIDAY%2C%5Ct%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%204%5Cn%5CtSATURDAY%2C%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%205%5Cn%5CtSUNDAY%5Ct%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%206%EF%BC%8C%20%E4%BE%9D%E6%AC%A1%E9%80%92%E5%A2%9E%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8Fenum%20weekday%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E7%9A%84today%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E6%8C%87%E6%98%8Etoday%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%96%E5%80%BC%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E6%98%AF%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%20%7BMONDAY%2CUESDAY%2CWEDNESDAY%2CTHURSDAY%2CFRIDAY%2CSATURDAY%2CSUNDAY%7D%5Cn%5Ctenum%20Weekday%20today%3B%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8FSUNDAY%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%5Cn%5Ctprintf(